  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "M4140-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A: 已确认某卷积模型部署时保留稠密原形状权重张量，用固定二值掩码将一半原本非零的标量权重置零。保存仍采用同一稠密格式；未测硬件时延或稀疏算子。作者想叫它unstructured weight pruning，也想声称参数存储与延迟均减半。请判断分别可否，写不超过45词的正向英文方法/结果说明；不因形状不变就自动断言完全不是剪枝，也不捏造加速。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Retain the accurately defined masked scalar-weight operation despite unchanged shape.",
        "Separate nonzero count from dense storage and unmeasured runtime."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Reject pruning solely because shapes remain unchanged.",
        "Infer half storage or latency from the mask ratio."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Retains accurate scalar-weight pruning with fixed tensor shape while separating nonzero count from dense storage and unmeasured runtime.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4140-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4140-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_three_identical_requests_on_frozen_final_source"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4140-B",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "B: 另一稿在每次梯度更新后把所有判别器标量权重限制到[-0.01,0.01]，例如[-0.03,0.005,0.04]变成[-0.01,0.005,0.01]；不按重要性挑子集、不删通道、不设稀疏掩码。其参考文献将此叫weight pruning。另有一篇预印本解释真实权重置零，但尚未证实发表。用户要将这两篇算作通用网络剪枝的两篇顶刊准入证据，并照字面翻译全部复合模块名。请用中文给出处理建议，并给不超过35词的英文计算描述。不要把一篇来源的用词当作操作等价证明；不要因此宣称该英文词普遍不能用。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Describe the stipulated interval computation and distinguish it from subset masking.",
        "Keep publication/version/Chinese wording states separate and decline an invalid two-journal match."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Count mismatched wording or an unverified preprint as two matched leading-journal definitions.",
        "Invent a general module translation or universally ban a valid English operation."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Describes interval clipping and rejects mismatched operation definitions, unconfirmed publication/version counting and unsupported compound translations.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4140-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4140-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_three_identical_requests_on_frozen_final_source"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4140-C",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "C: 纯虚构论文事实：工况迁移且标签类别不均衡使设备诊断困难；训练时同一样本的一种变换输入原编码器，另一种变换输入用二值掩码将部分低幅值权重置零的编码器副本。两路输出经共享投影后构成对比训练视图；推理仅保留原编码器及已知故障分类器，不调用掩码副本，不在线训练。已完成固定迁移测试，本法少数类召回率优于比较法，但多数类召回略降；未测显著性、时延或现场接入。本题请写约100-130词英文摘要的方法与实验部分，不补背景段，不写数值；说明掩码副本的实际训练用途与最终分类的承接，不编造完整模块专名、压缩部署或全部类别普遍改善。保留已观察收益与权衡，作者核查点放正文之外。",
      "required_behaviors": [
